%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/url_test.clj:105 (encodeURIComponent-test)
testing: Encode URI component - encodes special characters
元の形: url/encodeURIComponent の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import encodeURIComponent from dw::core::URL
output application/json
---
encodeURIComponent("foo/bar")
%%% output application/json
"foo%2Fbar"
